\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {1}{\ignorespaces Layer-wise validity-probe accuracy on the English (circles) and conlang (squares) splits. Probes peak in the middle of the network and saturate close to perfect accuracy on English; conlang reaches $0.959$ at layer $8$. Dashed line: chance.}}{3}{figure.caption.1}\protected@file@percent }
