\newlabel{fig:probe}{{1}{3}{Layer-wise validity-probe accuracy on the English (circles) and conlang (squares) splits. Probes peak in the middle of the network and saturate close to perfect accuracy on English; conlang reaches $\gptTwoProbeClPeak $ at layer $\gptTwoProbeClPeakLayer $. Dashed line: chance}{figure.caption.1}{}}
